    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/8524ee1b7c6c92a4adc9f8e9375e5993.poster.avif?t=1745229083\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/8524ee1b7c6c92a4adc9f8e9375e5993.webm?t=1745229083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/8524ee1b7c6c92a4adc9f8e9375e5993.mp4?t=1745229083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/aa096d72aa6682d5456cfa4d39250326.avif?t=1745229083\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you have what it takes to be a world class chef?</h2><i><strong>This is the roguelite that will give you a chance to prove it</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/ba4bbc592cc1a5c1bb7c30a0f4e729f8.avif?t=1745229083\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >With limited access to daily ingredients at the farmers market, you are going to have to get creative</h2><strong>Want to impress customers with something extravagant?</strong> <br><i>There will be consequences if you can't produce it</i><br><strong>Offer a bunch of cheap options instead?</strong> <br><i>Your income might suffer as a result</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/2d482953ed046e62ea5b7230f9e11e18.poster.avif?t=1745229083\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/2d482953ed046e62ea5b7230f9e11e18.webm?t=1745229083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/2d482953ed046e62ea5b7230f9e11e18.mp4?t=1745229083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/958c7b332265a4eb7db46b46a7404938.avif?t=1745229083\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you play it safe and send out meals one at a time, or are you desperate enough to risk it all for a bigger combo?</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/ca3a6709611d3b44990d655f0b17335e.poster.avif?t=1745229083\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/ca3a6709611d3b44990d655f0b17335e.webm?t=1745229083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/ca3a6709611d3b44990d655f0b17335e.mp4?t=1745229083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/de6796ed0d0723615d2c980804aad19f.avif?t=1745229083\" /></span><br><strong><i>*Exact dates may change as development progresses.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you would like to:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Share suggestions<br></li><li> Give feedback<br></li><li> Report bugs<br></li><li> Chat with the developer<br></li><li> Join in regular community activities (and possibly win a copy of the game!)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The best way to do that would be to..</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357970/extras/7444d278ea35024397f53b68f538c578.avif?t=1745229083\" /></span>",
